em,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动发布SeedRealtime全双工大模型并接入豆包App</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Visa宣布以24亿美元现金收购AI防诈公司BioCatch以强化金融风险检测</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek重启第二轮500亿元融资，投前估值升至5000亿元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里通义千问发布 Qwen-Image-3.0-Pro 模型，支持 10px 文字渲染</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ceebdfcbec3ff731e17fdaba0c48808e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里通义千问正式发布 Qwen-Image-3.0-Pro 与 Standard 图像模型，现已在 Qwen Cloud 上线。该模型在 Arena 文生图榜单中位列中国模型第一、主流模型第二。技术层面，Qwen-Image-3.0-Pro 支持 4.5k-token 超长提示词输入，具备 10px 级别的精细文字渲染能力，并覆盖 12 种语言。核心架构创新在于将生成与编辑功能合并至同一模型，无需分别调用，显著降低了多语言长文本排版等复杂任务的门槛与调用成本。定价方面，Pro 版单张起价 0.04 美元，Standard 版为 0.03 美元。此次更新通过压扁生产链路，使中小团队能够更低成本地进行高质量图像生成与编辑，提升了 AI 图像创作的生产效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌宣布 Google Classroom 的 Gemini 功能将于 8 月 10 日向全年龄段学生开放</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌宣布自 2026 年 8 月 10 日起，Google Classroom 中的 Gemini 功能将正式向 K-12 及高等教育全年龄段学生开放，前提是学校管理员已授予相应权限。此次更新将 AI 深度集成至学习流程，学生可在 Gemini 标签页中将课程资料一键转化为抽认卡、练习测验等互动工具，并支持同步至 Gemini Notebook 生成学习指南与音频概览。核心亮点在于新增的情境化引导提示功能，学生可针对特定课程与作业要求，让 Gemini 结合教学大纲提供针对性辅导。这种模式改变了以往泛泛的 AI 对话方式，使模型能够基于课程上下文，直接针对论文写作等具体任务提供建议，显著提升了 AI 在教育场景下的实用性与精准度。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动发布SeedRealtime全双工大模型并接入豆包App</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/148c170f4cd45b8934b9574a5e6c8918.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动Seed团队正式发布SeedRealtime，这是一款采用统一架构、原生融合音频、视频与文本的全双工大模型。该模型已在豆包App全量上线，标志着音视频全双工技术进入规模化落地阶段。与传统“听-转写-想-说”的级联方案不同，SeedRealtime通过端到端架构，让模型同时具备视觉、听觉与表达能力，一手接纳画面声音，一手直接生成回应。这种原生融合架构显著优化了对话节奏，使音视频交互中的抢话、停顿突兀等问题减少了50%，并具备更自然的交互分寸感，能像真人一样主动提醒或留出呼吸间隙。SeedRealtime的落地为全模态智能助手提供了新范式，即摆脱多模型管道串联，实现感知与表达的深度统一。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Visa宣布以24亿美元现金收购AI防诈公司BioCatch以强化金融风险检测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f1b735619e1f90d0ac918445b3efa9d7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">支付巨头Visa宣布将以24亿美元现金收购以色列AI金融防诈公司BioCatch，交易预计于2027年3月底前完成。BioCatch利用AI与机器学习技术，通过分析用户键盘鼠标操作、触控习惯及设备信息等超3000项行为数据，实时识别账户盗用、人头账户及受胁迫转账等风险。目前该系统每月分析约190亿次交互，服务全球350多家金融机构。Visa旨在通过此次收购，将防诈能力从支付环节前移至开户及登录阶段，构建覆盖全流程的风险拦截体系。面对生成式AI带来的诈骗威胁，Visa过去五年已投入超130亿美元用于安全基础设施建设，此次整合将进一步补充其现有的身份验证与风险管理产品矩阵，从源头提升支付网络的安全性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek重启第二轮500亿元融资，投前估值升至5000亿元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5314a732c3c072c146a3d9b6342f3f81.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">国内AI大模型龙头DeepSeek已正式重启第二轮融资，计划募资500亿元，投前估值达5000亿元，预计8月下旬完成签约。若本轮顺利交割，DeepSeek两轮累计募资将突破1000亿元，估值较今年6月完成的首轮融资提升约43%。DeepSeek首轮融资以超3500亿元估值募资500亿元，吸引了国家人工智能产业投资基金、腾讯、宁德时代、网易、京东及IDG资本等机构参投。由于首轮意向资金规模曾突破1000亿元，大量候补资金方顺延参与本轮。在当前AI大模型研发演进与算力竞争加剧的背景下，超千亿级资金注入将进一步强化DeepSeek在国产大模型领域的技术迭代与算力壁垒构建，并加剧行业梯队分化。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
